      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks for the breakdown. one thing that's tripping me up is the sound. when the turbo gets to high boost, it makes this really loud, piercing whistle or a howling noise. is that just a normal byproduct of the air moving through the blades so fast, or is it actually a sign of some kind of resonance or turbulence issue?",
